{"articleNo":"2361","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2361&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 동계방학 생활관 입관 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.13","hit":"18413","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009년도 동계방학 생활관 입관 신청 안내</span></span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"55\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">생활관 입사를 희망하는 학생은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">신청전에</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 학적부의 연락처를 변경하여 등록에 관한 안내사항(문자)을 받을 수 있도록 협조 바람.(집전화➡휴대폰으로 수정)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009학년도 동</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">계방학 기간동안 생활관 입관를 희망하는 재학생(휴학생 제외)은 다음과 같이 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccccff\" height=\"27\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"106\" colspan=\"2\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">항 목</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccccff\" height=\"27\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">구 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccccff\" height=\"27\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"424\" colspan=\"4\">\n          